 "caption": "MCP (Model Context Protocol) is an open standard Anthropic released in 2024. Instead of every AI app writing custom code for every tool, each tool exposes one MCP server and every MCP-speaking app can use it. Its own docs call it a USB-C port for AI. OpenAI and Google have since added support.",
